        {
          "title": "Self-Distillation Enables Continual Learning",
          "title_zh": "自蒸馏实现持续学习",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2601.19897v2",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2601.19897",
          "summary": "The authors introduce Self-Distillation Fine-Tuning (SDFT), which uses a demonstration-conditioned model as its own teacher to generate on-policy training signals without explicit reward functions. Across skill-learning and knowledge-acquisition tasks it reportedly outperforms supervised fine-tuning, with higher new-task accuracy and substantially less catastrophic forgetting, and it lets one model accumulate multiple skills sequentially without regression.",
