          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "DeepSeek",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2601.20102",
          "summary": "The paper introduces a counterfactual benchmark that expands 150 MedQA items into 1,650 variants with cultural identifier tokens and contextual cues. Across GPT-5.2, Llama-3.1-8B, DeepSeek-R1 and MedGemma, cultural cues significantly affected accuracy, with the largest degradation when identifier and context co-occurred.",
