          "summary": "The authors define zero-shot stance detection in the wild with dynamic target generation and multi-target adaptation, aiming to identify multiple target-stance pairs from text without prior target knowledge. On a new Chinese social-media dataset, a two-stage fine-tuned Qwen2.5-7B reached a 66.99% comprehensive target-recognition score, while an integrated fine-tuned DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B reached 79.26% stance-detection F1.",
